"# Button

Component set \`6-0\`. Used by: Checkout.

> Dev note: Primary call to action.

> Dev note: Only one per screen.

## Properties

| Property | Type | Default | Options |
|---|---|---|---|
| Variant | variant | Default | Default, Variant 2 |

## Variants

### Button (Variant=Default)

- **Variant=Default — Row, padding 0 16 0 16, width 160, height 44** \`3-0\`
  - size 160px × 44px; flow position 0 (not measured: from the authored style)
  - padding 0px 16px 0px 16px
  - fill #2563EBFF --color-brand; radius 8px
  - tokens: --color-brand
  - state hover: backgroundColor: var(--color-brand-hover)
  - dev note: Primary call to action.
  - dev note: Only one per screen.
  - **Label — Block, width fit, height fit** \`4-0\` (text)
    - size: fit content (not measured); flow position 0
    - text colour #FFFFFFFF
    - "Buy" · Inter, sans-serif, 16px, weight 600
    - contrast: Light 5.17:1 AA · Dark 2.54:1 fails AA

### Button (Variant=Variant 2)

- **Button / Large — Row, padding 0 16 0 16, width 160, height 56** \`7-0\`
  - size 160px × 56px; flow position 0 (not measured: from the authored style)
  - padding 0px 16px 0px 16px
  - fill #2563EBFF --color-brand; radius 8px
  - tokens: --color-brand
  - **Label — Block, width fit, height fit** \`8-0\` (text)
    - size: fit content (not measured); flow position 0
    - text colour #FFFFFFFF
    - "Buy" · Inter, sans-serif, 16px, weight 600
    - contrast: Light 5.17:1 AA · Dark 2.54:1 fails AA

## States

| State | How it is specified | Maps to | What changes |
|---|---|---|---|
| hover | described (state rule on the component) | :hover | backgroundColor → var(--color-brand-hover) |
| pressed | missing: not specified, use the project default | :active |  |
| focus | missing: not specified, use the project default | :focus |  |
| disabled | missing: not specified, use the project default | :disabled or \\[aria-disabled="true"] |  |
"
