"# Checkout

Screen \`9-0\`, 2 breakpoints. Build to the layout rules first; the numbers describe the design size.

Breakpoints, widest first: Desktop 1280px, Mobile 390px. Suggestion: write the narrowest layout first and add \`min-width\` media queries for the wider ones (container queries if the parent is a component). Widths in between follow the layout rules.

## Desktop · 1280px wide

Frame \`9-0\` · ready in handoff v1 · reference \`screens/checkout.desktop.png\`

> 1 node has fractional sizes (e.g. 347.5 × 52 for "Card"); build with the rule, not the number.

- **Checkout — Column, gap 16, padding 24, width 1280, height 800** \`9-0\`
  - size 1280px × 800px; at 0, 0 in artboard (not measured: from the authored style)
  - padding 24px 24px 24px 24px
  - fill #FFFFFFFF --color-surface
  - tokens: --color-surface
  - **Title — Block, width fit, height fit** \`10-0\` (text)
    - size: fit content (not measured); flow position 0
    - text colour #0F171FFF (authored oklch(0.2 0.02 250)) --color-text
    - "Pay now" · Inter, sans-serif, 28px, weight 700 · line height 36px (1.29) · text style Heading/H1
    - tokens: --text-xl, --color-text
    - contrast: Light 18.06:1 AAA · Dark 16.98:1 AAA
  - **Card — Row, gap 16, width 347.5, height 52** \`11-0\`
    - size 347.5px × 52px; flow position 1 (not measured: from the authored style)
    - fill #FFFFFFFF --color-surface; stroke 1px solid #E5E7EBFF; radius 12px
    - tokens: --space-4, --color-surface
    - accessibility: role region, label Order total
    - dev note: Collapses to a single column under 640px.
    - **needs decision:** Is the card tappable?
    - **Amount — Block, width fit, height fit** \`12-0\` (text)
      - size: fit content (not measured); flow position 0
      - text colour #0F171FFF (authored oklch(0.2 0.02 250)) --color-text
      - "Total 42.00" · Inter, sans-serif, 16px, weight 400
      - tokens: --color-text
      - contrast: Light 18.06:1 AAA · Dark 16.98:1 AAA
  - **Variant=Default — Row, padding 0 16 0 16, width 160, height 44** \`13-0\`
    - size 160px × 44px; flow position 2 (not measured: from the authored style)
    - padding 0px 16px 0px 16px
    - fill #2563EBFF --color-brand; radius 8px
    - tokens: --color-brand
    - component Button (Variant=Default)
    - **Label — Block, width fit, height fit** \`14-0\` (text)
      - size: fit content (not measured); flow position 0
      - text colour #FFFFFFFF
      - "Buy" · Inter, sans-serif, 16px, weight 600
      - contrast: Light 5.17:1 AA · Dark 2.54:1 fails AA
  - **Locked divider — Block, width 400, height 1** \`15-0\` (rect)
    - size 400px × 1px; flow position 3 (not measured: from the authored style)
    - fill #E5E7EBFF

## Mobile · 390px wide

Frame \`19-0\` · ready in handoff v1 · reference \`screens/checkout.mobile.png\`

Compared with Desktop (the base): 1 layer change, 3 not shown. Build the base, then apply these.

| Layer | What changes |
