"# Checkout

Screen \`9-0\`, 2 breakpoints. Build to the layout rules first; the numbers describe the design size.

Breakpoints, widest first: Desktop 100.25px, Mobile 100.25px. Suggestion: write the narrowest layout first and add \`min-width\` media queries for the wider ones (container queries if the parent is a component). Widths in between follow the layout rules.

## Desktop · 100.25px (6.2656rem) wide

Frame \`9-0\` · ready in handoff v1 · reference \`screens/checkout.desktop.png\`

> 7 nodes have fractional sizes (e.g. 100.25 × 40 for "Checkout"); build with the rule, not the number.

- **Checkout — Column, gap 16, padding 24, width 1280, height 800** \`9-0\`
  - size 100.25px (6.2656rem) × 40px (2.5rem); at 0, 0 in artboard
  - padding 24px (1.5rem) 24px (1.5rem) 24px (1.5rem) 24px (1.5rem)
  - fill #FFFFFFFF --color-surface
  - tokens: --color-surface
  - **Title — Block, width fit, height fit** \`10-0\` (text)
    - size 100.25px (6.2656rem) × 40px (2.5rem); flow position 0
    - text colour #0F171FFF (authored oklch(0.2 0.02 250)) --color-text
    - "Pay now" · Inter, sans-serif, 28px (1.75rem), weight 700 · line height 36px (1.29) · text style Heading/H1
    - tokens: --text-xl, --color-text
    - contrast: Light 18.06:1 AAA · Dark 16.98:1 AAA
  - **Card — Row, gap 16, width 347.5, height 52** \`11-0\`
    - size 100.25px (6.2656rem) × 40px (2.5rem); flow position 1
    - fill #FFFFFFFF --color-surface; stroke 1px solid #E5E7EBFF; radius 12px (0.75rem)
    - tokens: --space-4, --color-surface
    - accessibility: role region, label Order total
    - dev note: Collapses to a single column under 640px.
    - **needs decision:** Is the card tappable?
    - **Amount — Block, width fit, height fit** \`12-0\` (text)
      - size 100.25px (6.2656rem) × 40px (2.5rem); flow position 0
      - text colour #0F171FFF (authored oklch(0.2 0.02 250)) --color-text
      - "Total 42.00" · Inter, sans-serif, 16px (1rem), weight 400 · line height 40px (2.5) estimated
      - tokens: --color-text
      - contrast: Light 18.06:1 AAA · Dark 16.98:1 AAA
  - **Variant=Default — Row, padding 0 16 0 16, width 160, height 44** \`13-0\`
    - size 100.25px (6.2656rem) × 40px (2.5rem); flow position 2
